udgment or shame  just as much as any thin white  influencer pushing green juice and lemon  water there is an obvious double  standard would i love her to not imply  that we need to choke down green juice  to be healthy yes don't like that would  i love for her to not tote the benefits  of a bogus smoothie cleanse also yes i  talked about that a lot in my video  right here but i also think lizzo is on  her own journey and she does seem to  present a relatively neutral non-extreme  normal experience that i think a lot of  people can relate to one that's largely  grounded in balance and an unapologetic  joy for food but that also occasionally  dabbles and experiments with  pseudoscience woo she's not a perfect  bopo poster child and she's not a diet  culture diva either like most of us  she's just trying to figure out what  works for her and on that note that's  all that i have for you guys today thank  you again to buildbar for sponsoring  this video if you liked it be sure to  give it the thumbs up leave me a comment  below on who you'd like to see me review  next subscribe to the channel and i'll  see you next time on abby's kitchen bye
 

